  "releaseNotes": "Version 3.1.1: Bug fix release - Fixed ValueConverter support in ExecuteUpdate and ExecuteDelete operations.\n       Version 3.0.0: Migrated to .NET Standard 2.0 for maximum compatibility.\n       Removed Specification-based overloads for cleaner API surface.\n       All methods now use expression-based queries (Expression<Func<TEntity, bool>>).\n       Breaking change: Removed ISpecification-based method overloads.\n       Version 9.3.0: Added transaction support across repository operations.\n       New: ITransactionScope interface for managing database transactions across multiple operations.\n       All repository methods now support optional transaction scope parameter for atomic multi-operation scenarios.\n       Enhanced flexibility for complex business operations requiring transactional consistency.",
